而後進，不解帶、不盥櫛者累旬，景仁深懷感愧。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p003:m0020","object_person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p003:m0019"}],"interpretation_note":"第三弟原詞全存；只給景仁年長於甝，不把弟群第三名改為父允所有子女的絕對排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"id":"name-song052-han","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABD","surname":"謝","ming":"甝","additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p003","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p003:m0020","source_anchor":{"chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p003","mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xiejingren-near-family-rendered:p003:m0020","start":207,"end":208,"surface":"甝","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABD"},"quote":"述字景先，少有志行，隨兄純在江陵。純遇害，述奉純喪還都。行至西塞，值暴風，純喪舫流漂，不知所在，述乘小船尋求之。經純妻庾舫過，庾遣人謂述曰：「喪舫存沒，已應有在，風波如此，豈可小船所冒？小郎去必無及，寧可存亡俱盡邪。」述號泣答曰：「若安全至岸，當須營理。如其已致意外，述亦無心獨存。」因冒浪而進，見純喪幾沒，述號叫呼天，幸而獲免，咸以為精誠所致也。高祖聞而嘉之，及臨豫州，諷中正以述為主簿，甚被知器。景仁愛其第三弟甝而憎述，嘗設饌請高祖，希命甝豫坐，而高祖召述。述知非景仁夙意，又慮高祖命之，請急不從。高祖馳遣呼述，須至乃歡。及景仁有疾，述盡心營視，湯藥飲食，必嘗而後進，不解帶、不盥櫛者累旬，景仁深懷感愧。","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"note":"本名及字依原句；部分省姓以具名近系／同段氏族語境復原，原文與原稱不改，不宣稱省姓處是完整姓名原字。","surname_basis":{"kind":"contextual_surname_from_source_bound_kinship_graph","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"rationale":"字面源姓與已保存的父系來源／有資格編者近系路徑；只復姓，不新建父子，不改原字、字號或排行。","frames":[{"native_path":"corpus/nanshi/019-xieyu-opening-rendered.json","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-opening-rendered:p001","paragraph_sha256":"6bf52e74380f771213f94968d220329574904378768